n":"text-start","button_label":"","button_link":"","layout":"grid","spacing":32,"logo_grid_align":"justify-center","color_scheme":"none","full_width":true}},"media_with_text_LQiCtW":{"type":"media-with-text","blocks":{"heading_LcHwmH":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"WHY CHOOSE MONUMENT GRILLS?","one_color":"#2a2b2a","two_color":"#2a2b2a","color_angle":"45","heading_size":"h3","title_weight":true,"title_uppercase":false,"heading_h1":false}},"text_jYDqhf":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Monument Grills is known for premium craftsmanship, innovative designs, and durable products that outdoor cooking enthusiasts love.<\/p><ol><li>Monument Grills is a trusted name in the grilling industry. Our products are built to last, with many satisfied customers worldwide.<\/li><li>Customer Satisfaction Guarantee: Our grills and accessories are backed by customer satisfaction guarantees, ensuring that your audience will love the products you recommend.<\/li><li>Fast, Secure Shipping: With our efficient shipping processes, customers will receive their orders promptly and securely.<\/li><\/ol>","enlarge_text":false,"enlarge_new_text":false,"text_size":"h6","text_color":""}}},"block_order":["heading_LcHwmH","text_jYDqhf"],"custom_css":["li::marker {border: 1px solid #000; color: #bf0000; font-size: 18px; padding: 0; font-weight: bold;}","ol {background: #f1f1f1; padding: 20px 20px 20px 40px; margin: 0;}"],"settings":{"link_id":"","full_screen":false,"max_content_width":"","rounded_design":false,"media_rounded_size":"40","grid_layout":false,"angle_size":"","padding_top":60,"padding_bottom":40,"layout":"left","image_fit":"contain","media_width":50,"media_scale":100,"title_weight":false,"title_uppercase":false,"heading":"","heading_size":"h2","header_text":"","enlarge_text":true,"text_size":"p","header_text_position":"justify-center","text_align":"text-start","show_text_color":false,"set_text_color":"","full_screen_bg":"#ffffff","color_scheme":"none","only_content_color_scheme":false,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/5_01d479f3-240b-4d25-b41b-5f395ba25551.jpg","img_url":"","img_alt":"","video_external":"","video_description":"","video_autoplay":false}},"faq_Rhf9RR":{"type":"faq","blocks":{"question_tNfY8E":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"question_mark","heading":"What is the Monument affiliate program and how does it work?","text":"<p>The Monument affiliate program is a service that allows participating websites to earn commission on sales referred to <a href=\"https:\/\/monumentgrills.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https:\/\/monumentgrills.com\/\">monumentgrills.com<\/a> using specially tracked links. We provide you with custom links and assets that you can post on your website. When a customer you’ve referred to us makes a purchase, we’ll keep track and give you a commission on the sale.<\/p>","read_number":0}},"question_d6d4MQ":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"question_mark","heading":"Is my website eligible for the Monument affiliate program?","text":"<p>Our affiliate program accepts many websites that are relevant to our products and do not contain objectionable content. While anyone may submit an application and we are open to many types of sites, we reserve the right to refuse or revoke membership at any time as we see fit.<\/p>","read_number":0}},"question_prg9Ag":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"question_mark","heading":"Does the affiliate program require any fees?","text":"<p>There are no fees associated with the Monument affiliate program. It’s completely free to participate.<\/p>","read_number":0}},"question_qLqfcw":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"question_mark","heading":"Can I become an affiliate if I live outside the USA?","text":"<p>Yes! We are open to international partners.However, our products are only sold in the United States.<\/p>","read_number":0}},"question_cYniNe":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"question_mark","heading":"How do I track my earnings?","text":"<p>You can access reports with this information through your sales dashboard. Reports are updated daily and provide insights on impressions, clicks, and commissions earned.<\/p>","read_number":0}},"question_raaPAW":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"question_mark","heading":"Can I promote Monument Grills on social media?","text":"<p>Yes! We encourage affiliates to share their unique links on social media platforms, blogs, or websites. Just make sure to follow the terms and conditions provided in the program guidelines.<\/p>","read_number":0}},"question_L6Kw4e":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"question_mark","heading":"Are there any restrictions on where I can promote Grills?","text":"<p>You may promote Monument Grills through your own website, blog, and social media platforms. However, using paid ads (such as PPC) on platforms like Google or Facebook is subject to approval. Please refer to our guidelines for more details.<\/p>","read_number":0}},"question_MKwPRn":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"question_mark","heading":"What marketing materials are provided to affiliates?","text":"<p>Upon approval, affiliates will gain access to banners, links, and promotional content to help drive traffic to Monument Grills products. We offer a variety of materials to suit different promotional methods.<\/p>","read_number":0}},"question_MG7mhQ":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"question_mark","heading":"Can I track my affiliate performance?","text":"<p>Yes, through the affiliate networks ShareASale, Impact, and BixGrow, you’ll have access to a real-time dashboard where you can track your clicks, conversions, and earnings.<\/p>","read_number":0}},"question_GJxnab":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"question_mark","heading":"How do I contact support if I have questions?","text":"<p>If you have any questions or need assistance with your affiliate account, feel free to reach out to us via the affiliate platform’s support system or contact us directly through our website.<\/p>","read_number":0}}},"block_order":["question_tNfY8E","question_d6d4MQ","question_prg9Ag","question_qLqfcw","question_cYniNe","question_raaPAW","question_L6Kw4e","question_MKwPRn","question_MG7mhQ","question_GJxnab"],"settings":{"heading":"FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS","heading_align":"text-center","color_scheme":"none","full_width":false}}},"order":["main","use_image_banner_HYx4qF","media_with_text_3ALQ7n","icons_with_text_XGFaT7","custom_liquid_QrDbEW","custom_liquid_g4rVyD","rich_text_yQCANG","logo_list_GRpdRQ","media_with_text_LQiCtW","faq_Rhf9RR"]}